{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Izari have just invaded your hometown, and they don't plan on stopping.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your martial arts move you learned as a fire master to destroy your enemies in brutal fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/660fc949707a3336ea70e1ec0f574e64.poster.avif?t=1761144416\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/660fc949707a3336ea70e1ec0f574e64.webm?t=1761144416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/660fc949707a3336ea70e1ec0f574e64.mp4?t=1761144416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up enemy clubs, knives, guns and even limbs to deal massive damage.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/a692c4214572ccbfda8422ea04f48cd4.poster.avif?t=1761144416\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/a692c4214572ccbfda8422ea04f48cd4.webm?t=1761144416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/a692c4214572ccbfda8422ea04f48cd4.mp4?t=1761144416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save villagers in hard to reach spots to regain health and bring balance back to kagetsu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/7e41315ba524a6d96043c1d87dd8a91d.poster.avif?t=1761144416\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/7e41315ba524a6d96043c1d87dd8a91d.webm?t=1761144416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/7e41315ba524a6d96043c1d87dd8a91d.mp4?t=1761144416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate lone enemies to discover the location of your next objective.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/4b42671af9089edd81e1b3db98243d08.poster.avif?t=1761144416\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/4b42671af9089edd81e1b3db98243d08.webm?t=1761144416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/4b42671af9089edd81e1b3db98243d08.mp4?t=1761144416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up enough rage to unleash a devastating fireball attack that literally incinerates your enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/91bc4984fe519c6ef3118935c2538c5f.poster.avif?t=1761144416\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/91bc4984fe519c6ef3118935c2538c5f.webm?t=1761144416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878960/extras/91bc4984fe519c6ef3118935c2538c5f.mp4?t=1761144416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>